as the one that collapsed in Pittsburgh. And this&nbsp;
is for New Jersey, and it has a map so you can see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:52.480
which which are nearby. But it points out on the&nbsp;
f h w A's national bridge inventory for 2021 482,&nbsp;&nbsp;

