railway bridges over which trains are transiting.&nbsp;
So obviously most of these bridges rated poor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:50.480
are not going to collapse. I saw a comment from&nbsp;
a bridge engineer who has explained that also,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:55.280
