category it's in that there's lots of bridges that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:01.440
look very bad cosmetically but structurally&nbsp;
are actually in that category. Good, even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:07.040
though if you if you or I looked at it, we would&nbsp;
